        '我们把电机、驱动、传感器和工具链放在同一条工程基线上，让运动控制更容易被理解、验证与集成。': 'We bring motors, drives, sensors, and tools onto one engineering baseline, making motion control easier to understand, verify, and integrate.',
        '了解我们的工作': 'See how we work',
        '让精密运动，': 'Make precision motion',
        '成为可以复用的': 'a reusable',
        '工程能力。': 'engineering capability.',
        '从驱控一体伺服电机出发，我们把真实系统中的响应、精度与集成经验，沉淀成产品、资料和工具。': 'Starting with integrated servo motors, we turn real-world experience in response, precision, and integration into products, documentation, and tools.',
        'QD4310 驱控一体中空无刷伺服电机': 'QD4310 integrated hollow-shaft brushless servo motor',
        '驱控一体中空无刷伺服电机': 'Integrated hollow-shaft brushless servo motor',
        '我们不只做一台电机。': 'We build more than a motor.',
        'QDrive Tech 构建的是一套围绕精密运动展开的工程平台。': 'QDrive Tech is an engineering platform built around precision motion.',
        '核心产品覆盖驱动、控制与角度感知，并通过网页上位机、例程、固件和参考设计把能力延伸到真实系统。开发者可以从单轴验证开始，再进入云台、移动载体或自己的设备，而不必每次重建工具链。': 'Our core products cover drive, control, and position sensing. Web hosts, examples, firmware, and reference designs extend those capabilities into real systems. Developers can start with single-axis validation, then move into gimbals, mobile platforms, or their own devices without rebuilding the toolchain each time.',
        '我们也与高校、整机团队和开发者协作，让测试数据、接口定义、版本记录与现场表现尽可能保持一致。可预期的边界，比模糊的参数承诺更有价值。': 'We also work with universities, system teams, and developers to keep test data, interface definitions, version records, and field performance aligned. Predictable limits are more valuable than vague specifications.',
        'QDrive Tech 工程原则': 'QDrive Tech engineering principles',
        '用验证代替想象': 'Verify instead of assuming',
        '以数据、测试和清晰文档支撑产品决策，让每个参数都能回到真实工况。': 'Use data, testing, and clear documentation to support product decisions, so every specification can be traced to real operating conditions.',
        '为集成保留余地': 'Leave room for integration',
        '稳定接口、明确控制语义和可复用工具，让开发资源回到算法与产品本身。': 'Stable interfaces, clear control semantics, and reusable tools let teams focus on algorithms and products.',
        '让迭代可以追溯': 'Make every iteration traceable',
        '同步维护硬件、固件与资料，给升级路径留下说明，也认真对待旧项目的连续性。': 'Maintain hardware, firmware, and documentation together, explain upgrade paths, and preserve continuity for existing projects.',
        '从一个运动内核，到多种系统形态。': 'One motion core, many system forms.',
        '电机不是终点。我们用稳定、指向、平衡与移动这些真实任务，检验同一套控制能力能否被持续复用。': 'The motor is not the destination. We use real tasks such as stabilization, pointing, balance, and mobility to test whether the same control capabilities remain reusable.',
