        '继续了解 QDrive': 'Continue with QDrive',
        '从真实工程问题出发的技术记录': 'Technical notes from real engineering work',
        '我们如何理解精密运动与产品': 'How we think about precision motion and products',
        '向未知发问，在尊重中协作，让创新持续演进。': 'Ask what is unknown. Build with respect. Keep innovation moving.',
        '从 Quest 到 Evolve，六个词构成 QDrive，也标定我们的行动尺度：向未知发问，在尊重中协作，让创新持续演进。': 'From Quest to Evolve, six words shape QDrive and how we work: question the unknown, collaborate with respect, and keep innovation moving.',
        '驱控一体中空无刷伺服电机。把高精度编码、丰富通讯和多种控制模式，压缩进一个清晰、可集成的运动单元。': 'An integrated hollow-shaft brushless servo motor, bringing precise encoding, rich communications, and flexible control into one clear, integrable motion unit.',
        '电机不是终点。它是每个运动系统的起点。': 'The motor is not the destination. It is where every motion system begins.',
        '集成，而不是堆叠': 'Integrate, do not stack',
        '控制有据可循': 'Control with evidence',
        '从原型走向系统': 'From prototype to system',
        '一个内核，多种运动形态。': 'One core, many forms of motion.',
        '我们用真实的应用系统验证控制平台：稳定、指向、平衡与移动，每一种形态都回到同一套精密运动语言。': 'We validate the control platform in real systems: stabilization, pointing, balance, and mobility, all grounded in one precise motion language.',
        '串口、CAN、电机与云台上位机集中在网页端。连接设备、观察波形、修改参数，不让工具链成为工程验证的阻力。': 'Serial, CAN, motor, and gimbal tools live in the browser. Connect devices, inspect waveforms, and tune parameters without toolchain friction.',
        '电机、驱动与角度传感器形成单一运动单元，减少机械空间、线束和系统集成成本。': 'Motor, drive, and angle sensing form one motion unit, reducing mechanical space, wiring, and integration cost.',
        '电流、速度、角度控制覆盖从底层调试到应用开发，并通过网页上位机直接观察真实响应。': 'Current, speed, and position control span low-level tuning to application development, with live response visible in the web host.',
        '统一的电机平台延伸至云台与移动载体，让验证过的能力能够被复用，而不是每次从零开始。': 'One motor platform extends to gimbals and mobile carriers, so proven capabilities can be reused instead of rebuilt from scratch.',
        '活动说明': 'Event details',
