        '商务与合作': 'Business and partnerships',
        '样品、批量采购或定制需求，欢迎邮件联系；页脚亦提供社群入口。': 'For samples, volume orders, or custom work, email us. Community links are also available in the footer.',
        '我们持续投入高速响应、高集成度与高可靠性的伺服与驱动技术，为客户提供高性能、高品质、集成化、智能化的电机伺服电机产品，并与高校院所、整机厂商及开发者生态协作，完善手册、工具链、标定与量产导入流程。 我们支持参考设计、定制接口与联合开发，服务从概念验证、中小批量到规模化交付的全链路，把可预期的性能边界与可持续迭代的工程基线，带到全球更多需要精密运动控制的场景。': 'We invest in high-response, highly integrated, and reliable servo and drive technology. We deliver high-performance, intelligent motor products while collaborating with universities, system makers, and developers to improve manuals, tools, calibration, and production onboarding. We support reference designs, custom interfaces, and joint development from proof of concept through volume delivery, bringing predictable performance and an upgradeable engineering baseline to more precision-motion applications worldwide.',
        '公司秉持以下原则：伺服与运动控制产品须具备清晰可读的接口定义、稳定可预期的控制语义，以及便于工程落地的对接方式。技术文档、测试数据与现场表现须保持一致性与可核验性，不以非正式的口头约定替代书面规范。在持续迭代的研发节奏下，我们建立版本可追溯与升级路径可预期的机制，使用户能够将主要资源集中于算法、结构及产品化等核心价值环节。': 'Our products follow a simple principle: servo and motion-control systems need readable interfaces, predictable control semantics, and practical integration paths. Documentation, test data, and field behavior must stay consistent and verifiable. With traceable versions and predictable upgrade paths, users can focus on algorithms, mechanics, and productization.',
        '以工程可落地为先，用数据、测试与文档支撑产品决策，减少「概念先行、落地滞后」的落差。': 'Put engineering reality first. Use data, tests, and documentation to make decisions, reducing the gap between concept and delivery.',
        '重视社区与教学场景中的真实反馈，持续完善资料结构与工具链，让更多人能顺利上手。': 'Listen to real feedback from communities and classrooms, and keep improving the documentation and toolchain so more people can get started.',
        '关注量产一致性与售后响应，在固件与硬件迭代中尽量保持兼容与说明同步，对用户的项目进度认真对待。': 'Care about production consistency and support response. Keep firmware, hardware, and documentation aligned while respecting every project timeline.',
        '中空无刷轮毂伺服平台：驱控一体，资料与固件集中维护。': 'Hollow-shaft brushless hub-servo platform with integrated drive and centralized firmware resources.',
        '二维云台方案：继承平台电机的响应与精度，面向增稳与视觉跟踪类应用。': 'Two-axis gimbal solution inheriting the platform motor response and precision for stabilization and visual tracking.',
        '二轮平衡车参考设计：轮毂伺服内置，适合教学实验与控制算法验证。': 'Two-wheel balancing vehicle reference design with built-in hub servos for teaching and control validation.',
        '持续打磨控制与热设计，保证量产与长时运行一致性': 'Refine control and thermal design for consistent production and long runtimes',
        '手册、例程与上位机工具同步迭代，降低上手成本': 'Evolve manuals, examples, and web tools together to shorten the learning curve',
        '在统一平台上延伸云台、小车等典型应用参考设计': 'Extend the unified platform into reference designs for gimbals, vehicles, and more',
        '技术博客与社群答疑，沉淀工程经验与最佳实践': 'Share engineering experience and best practices through notes and community support',
        '产品手册、例程代码、配套工具、3D 模型与各版本固件（DFU）。': 'Product manuals, example code, companion tools, 3D models, and firmware releases (DFU).',
